# Normalize line endings across platforms.
# Without this, CRLF/LF drift on Windows checkouts repeatedly trips Prettier
# in CI and locally. `text=auto eol=lf` forces all text files to LF on
# checkout regardless of `core.autocrlf`.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark binaries so git doesn't try to normalize them.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.eot    binary
*.pdf    binary
